start: mr
R1: 4ch=tr {6tr [3ch 7tr]x3 3ch}@ring join
R2: 4ch=tr ch [tr ch]x5 [tr 5ch [tr ch]x6]x3 tr 5ch ss@top # ch 5 = 1 tr + ch 1
R3: sl@sp sc@same [[3ch sc@sp]x5 7ch sk sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x5 7ch sk join
R4: sl@sp sc@same [[3ch sc@sp]x4 5ch {sc 5ch sc 5ch}@sp sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x4 5ch {sc 5ch sc 5ch}@sp join
R5: sl@sp sc@same [[3ch sc@sp]x3 5ch sk {dc 5ch dc 5ch dc 5ch}@sp sk sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x3 5ch sk {dc 5ch dc 5ch dc 5ch}@sp sk join
R6: sl@sp sc@same [[3ch sc@sp]x2 5ch sk 7tr@sp 3ch 7tr@sp 5ch sk sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x2 5ch sk 7tr@sp 3ch 7tr@sp 5ch sk join
R7: sl@sp sc@same [3ch sc@sp 5ch [tr ch]x6 tr 7ch [tr ch]x6 tr 5ch sk sc@sp]x3 3ch sc@sp 5ch [tr ch]x6 tr 7ch [tr ch]x6 tr 5ch sk join
R8: sl@sp {3ch=dc 3ch dc}@same [5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x5 sc@sp 8ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x5 sc@sp 5ch sk {dc 3ch dc}@sp]x3 5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x5 sc@sp 8ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x5 sc@sp 5ch sk ss@top # ch 6 = 1 dc + ch 3
R9: sl@sp {sc 3ch sc}@same [5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x4 sc@sp 5ch {sc 5ch sc 5ch}@sp [sc@sp 3ch]x4 sc@sp 5ch sk {sc 3ch sc}@sp]x3 5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x4 sc@sp 5ch {sc 5ch sc 5ch}@sp [sc@sp 3ch]x4 sc@sp 5ch sk join
R10: sl@sp {3ch=dc 5ch dc}@same [5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x3 sc@sp 5ch sk {dc 5ch dc 5ch dc 5ch}@sp sk [sc@sp 3ch]x3 sc@sp 5ch sk {dc 5ch dc}@sp]x3 5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x3 sc@sp 5ch sk {dc 5ch dc 5ch dc 5ch}@sp sk [sc@sp 3ch]x3 sc@sp 5ch sk ss@top # ch 8 = 1 dc + ch 5
R11: sl@sp {4ch=tr 6tr}@same [5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x2 sc@sp 5ch sk 7tr@sp 3ch 7tr@sp 5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x2 sc@sp 5ch sk 7tr@sp]x3 5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x2 sc@sp 5ch sk 7tr@sp 3ch 7tr@sp 5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x2 sc@sp 5ch sk join
R12: sc@same [9ch 5sk sc 9ch sk sc@sp 3ch sc@sp 9ch sc 9ch 5sk sc 15ch sc 9ch 5sk sc 9ch sk sc@sp 3ch sc@sp 9ch sc]x3 9ch 5sk sc 9ch sk sc@sp 3ch sc@sp 9ch sc 9ch 5sk sc 15ch sc 9ch 5sk sc 9ch sk sc@sp 3ch sc@sp 9ch join fo
